.TH "mtx-profile" "1" "01-01-2026" "version 1.00" "ConTeXt MkIV LuaTeX Profiler"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
 mtx-profile \- ConTeXt MkIV LuaTeX Profiler
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B mtxrun --script profile [
.I OPTIONS ...
.B ] [
.I FILENAMES
.B ]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.B ConTeXt MkIV LuaTeX Profiler
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
.B --analyze
analyze lua calls
.TP
.B --trace
analyze tex calls
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
More information about ConTeXt and the tools that come with it can be found at:


